	"gaits/glider_turn_bank": "Titans only: how far the body rolls into a turn at full turn (rad).",
	"gaits/glider_visual": "The model\'s animation for each stride. Tail bend: the tail sweeps across and back. Flap: the side flaps beat down with the push. Fluke: the tail beats up and down. Bell pulse: the bell contracts and expands with strides (no tail beat) and leans as it swims.",
