	"powerups/boss_item_every_player": "Boss items (planning_bosses_and_survival.md §2): each final boss\'s chest holds its own, which stacks, takes no weapon slot and is outside the item limits. boss_item_every_player: in co-op every player gets a copy from the chest (Risk of Rain 2\'s way); off, whoever opens it first takes it and it\'s gone for the rest.",
	"powerups/bow_growth": "Wearing the bow makes the bow wave bigger (its length and girth times 1 + bow_growth per stack), so you batter far wider. From bow_low_speed_stacks stacks on, the bow wave batters below the battering speed too (down to bow_low_speed of it).",
