	"powerups/coil_arrive_level": "The King of Herrings\' boss item: coil_segments (+ the count facet) glowing coils trail the fish coil_spacing m apart; every coil_tick s each hurts what it touches (coil_radius) for coil_damage, proc coil_proc. It works at level coil_arrive_level with one stack, coil_levels_per_stack more each stack after: its milestones by that level, and a facet step for each level below it, in turn: coil_segments_per_stack more coils, coil_damage_step damage, coil_radius_step coil size, coil_rate_step hit rate. coil_stacks: a stacks override for testing.",
