	"powerups/haze_creep": "A weapon, the Alchemists\' own (big_changes.md §5). Every haze_interval s (divided by 1 + the rate facet, and by attack speed weighted haze_speed_weight) it scatters haze_per_scatter bombs (+ the bombs facet, + Quantity) over haze_scatter_time s, each lobbed over haze_lob_time s at the densest pack within haze_reach m in any direction (times Size; led by the pack\'s velocity), the rest round it, or fanned round the fish if nothing\'s near (held while nothing is). Each bursts as it lands into a cloud haze_radius m round (times 1 + the size facet, times Size) lasting haze_life s (+ the life facet, times 1 + Duration): every haze_tick s it does haze_damage (times 1 + its facet) to each zombie in it, proc haze_proc, and hazes them (they drift with haze_slow of their speed taken). At most haze_max clouds (the oldest go). Lv milestones: Opaline (haze_film_slow for haze_film_time s after leaving a cloud); touching clouds merge; zombies that die hazed burst into a small cloud; clouds creep at haze_creep m/s toward the nearest zombie. A facet step: haze_damage_step damage, haze_size_step size, haze_life_step s of life, haze_count_step bombs, haze_rate_step scatter rate. haze_stacks: a level override for testing.",
