	"unnatural/alternate_boss_chance": "Which final boss comes: the King of Herrings (a giant rotting oarfish), or one of its alternates, by alternate_boss_chance (each equally likely): the Gulper Mother, the Whale Fall, the Lamprey Queen, the Fallen Angel. Pick one to always get it (testing). They share the Blood Leviathan group\'s hp, speed and timings.",
	"unnatural/anemones": "Corals (staghorn, brain, table and fan) and sponges (tube, barrel), in reef patches.",
	"unnatural/angel_aggression": "How hard the final bosses press (the Fallen Angel\'s pressure is the target): boss_aggression multiplies how often they attack (dives, chomps, bolts, gulps and sucks, lunges, hagfish strikes) and divides their rests; each boss\'s own value multiplies it again (1: as tuned, 2: twice as often).",
	"unnatural/angel_beat": "The Fallen Angel (a zombie sea angel, big_changes.md §3): angel_height m from its horns to its tail tip, hovering upright on wingbeats every angel_beat s. It locks on to a player, its head bursting into a crown of six tentacles over angel_crown s (angel_fury_crown in fury), then tumbles in for angel_flurry s, lashing angel_lashes times (angel_fury_lashes in fury) at everything within angel_lash_reach m of its head and angel_lash_cone degrees of the lash. A lash grabs a player (held as the Gulper holds) unless they strode within angel_dodge s before it, and eats the zombies it catches (each healing angel_eat_heal of its max hp). It rests angel_rest s between flurries. Hits on its glowing head and gut do angel_weak times the damage, angel_crown_weak times more while the crown\'s open. From two thirds it sheds angel_butterflies Sea Butterflies each time it would spit, and turns its flurries on them when they\'re near (angel_butterfly_heal each).",
