	"unnatural/angel_lock_gap": "Its lock-on, as the clip\'s angel shadows its butterfly: it picks a player and holds itself angel_lock_gap m off them (times angel_lash_reach), matching their every move and circling them at angel_orbit rad/s, a pale halo round them closing as it locks; after angel_lock_time s locked on, its crown opens.",
