	"unnatural/angel_orbit": "Its lock-on, as the clip\'s angel shadows its butterfly: it picks a player and holds itself angel_lock_gap m off them (times angel_lash_reach), matching their every move and circling them at angel_orbit rad/s, a pale halo round them closing as it locks; after angel_lock_time s locked on, its crown opens.",
	"unnatural/angel_regrab_time": "The Fallen Angel\'s own regrab time (the boss the others are tuned to keeps its old 2.5 s): it can\'t crown anyone again for angel_regrab_time s.",
	"unnatural/angel_rest": "The Fallen Angel (a zombie sea angel, big_changes.md §3): angel_height m from its horns to its tail tip, hovering upright on wingbeats every angel_beat s. It locks on to a player, its head bursting into a crown of six tentacles over angel_crown s (angel_fury_crown in fury), then tumbles in for angel_flurry s, lashing angel_lashes times (angel_fury_lashes in fury) at everything within angel_lash_reach m of its head and angel_lash_cone degrees of the lash. A lash grabs a player (held as the Gulper holds) unless they strode within angel_dodge s before it, and eats the zombies it catches (each healing angel_eat_heal of its max hp). It rests angel_rest s between flurries. Hits on its glowing head and gut do angel_weak times the damage, angel_crown_weak times more while the crown\'s open. From two thirds it sheds angel_butterflies Sea Butterflies each time it would spit, and turns its flurries on them when they\'re near (angel_butterfly_heal each).",
	"unnatural/angel_weak": "The Fallen Angel (a zombie sea angel, big_changes.md §3): angel_height m from its horns to its tail tip, hovering upright on wingbeats every angel_beat s. It locks on to a player, its head bursting into a crown of six tentacles over angel_crown s (angel_fury_crown in fury), then tumbles in for angel_flurry s, lashing angel_lashes times (angel_fury_lashes in fury) at everything within angel_lash_reach m of its head and angel_lash_cone degrees of the lash. A lash grabs a player (held as the Gulper holds) unless they strode within angel_dodge s before it, and eats the zombies it catches (each healing angel_eat_heal of its max hp). It rests angel_rest s between flurries. Hits on its glowing head and gut do angel_weak times the damage, angel_crown_weak times more while the crown\'s open. From two thirds it sheds angel_butterflies Sea Butterflies each time it would spit, and turns its flurries on them when they\'re near (angel_butterfly_heal each).",
