	"unnatural/blood_cloud_damage": "The Lamprey Queen: every brood_every s one of her brood drops off as brood_count zombies; hits on her gill holes do gill_bonus times the damage; spitting, her gills pulse out blood clouds (blood_cloud_damage a touch).",
	"unnatural/blood_moon": "The blood moon\'s strength: the red in the fog and light (0: plain ocean).",
	"unnatural/boss_aggression": "How hard the final bosses press (the Fallen Angel\'s pressure is the target): boss_aggression multiplies how often they attack (dives, chomps, bolts, gulps and sucks, lunges, hagfish strikes) and divides their rests; each boss\'s own value multiplies it again (1: as tuned, 2: twice as often).",
	"unnatural/boss_cleanup": "When the boss comes, the zombies further than this from every player (m) are cleared away (0: none are).",
	"unnatural/boss_pearls": "Pearls are the currency (D23): chests cost them. A kill drops one by chance, pearl_drop_chance x (1 + the killer\'s Pearl Chance); an elite\'s by pearl_elite_chance (likewise), worth pearl_elite_value; a beaten mini-boss drops boss_pearls.",
	"unnatural/boss_stalk_range": "Stalking: a final boss whose target is further than boss_stalk_range m turns and closes at boss_stalk_speed times its speed instead of keeping its course, so none can be out-swum for long (the Whale Fall\'s carcass stays put: a hagfish tears free and hunts instead).",
	"unnatural/boss_stalk_speed": "Stalking: a final boss whose target is further than boss_stalk_range m turns and closes at boss_stalk_speed times its speed instead of keeping its course, so none can be out-swum for long (the Whale Fall\'s carcass stays put: a hagfish tears free and hunts instead).",
	"unnatural/boss_time": "The stage\'s timeline (StageTimeline, D5): when each event comes (s into the run; 0 skips it). Off: no events, just the director\'s curve.",
	"unnatural/brace_cooldown": "Boxfish, Brace: for brace_time s it takes brace_taken of the damage and swims at brace_speed of its speed.",
