	"unnatural/calm_intensity": "Mowing through them too easily (each player killing easy_kill_rate a second or more, over the last 10 s, while intensity is under calm_intensity) raises the pressure, a multiplier on the target alive, by pressure_rate a second up to pressure_max; high intensity lowers it, down to pressure_min.",
	"unnatural/camera_climb": "How much of the fish\'s climb or dive it follows (0: always level).",
	"unnatural/camera_crowd_full": "The survivor cam pulls back as the horde thickens round you: up to camera_crowd_pull m further once camera_crowd_full zombies are within camera_crowd_range m; and camera_size_pull m per +100% of the Size stat, so big builds still fit. It eases there at camera_pull_rate (1/s).",
	"unnatural/camera_crowd_pull": "The survivor cam pulls back as the horde thickens round you: up to camera_crowd_pull m further once camera_crowd_full zombies are within camera_crowd_range m; and camera_size_pull m per +100% of the Size stat, so big builds still fit. It eases there at camera_pull_rate (1/s).",
	"unnatural/camera_crowd_range": "The survivor cam pulls back as the horde thickens round you: up to camera_crowd_pull m further once camera_crowd_full zombies are within camera_crowd_range m; and camera_size_pull m per +100% of the Size stat, so big builds still fit. It eases there at camera_pull_rate (1/s).",
	"unnatural/camera_distance": "Further back, higher and tilted further down than the tuned chase view (m, m, degrees), to see the horde around you.",
	"unnatural/camera_follow": "Follow cam\'s style. Settle: follows slowly while the fish turns, so you see it turn, and swings round behind it once it swims straight (camera_settle_*). Hold: holds its direction while accelerate, reverse or boost is held, and swings round behind once they\'re let go (camera_swing_rate). Always: always turns, at camera_turn_rate.",
	"unnatural/camera_height": "Further back, higher and tilted further down than the tuned chase view (m, m, degrees), to see the horde around you.",
	"unnatural/camera_mode": "Which survivor cam each player starts with; the ball cam button swaps them. Follow turns with the way the fish swims. Free turns only with the right stick, and stays where it\'s put.",
	"unnatural/camera_pull_rate": "The survivor cam pulls back as the horde thickens round you: up to camera_crowd_pull m further once camera_crowd_full zombies are within camera_crowd_range m; and camera_size_pull m per +100% of the Size stat, so big builds still fit. It eases there at camera_pull_rate (1/s).",
	"unnatural/camera_settle_coast_ease": "Settle: how quickly it swings round behind the fish once accelerate, reverse and boost are let go, turning or not (1/s; 0: no faster than swimming), and how long that takes to come in (s).",
	"unnatural/camera_settle_coast_rate": "Settle: how quickly it swings round behind the fish once accelerate, reverse and boost are let go, turning or not (1/s; 0: no faster than swimming), and how long that takes to come in (s).",
	"unnatural/camera_settle_delay": "Settle: how long its swing round behind takes to build up once a turn ends (s; 0: at once).",
	"unnatural/camera_settle_max_angle": "Settle: how far the fish can turn off to the side before the camera turns with it (degrees; 180: any way, even facing you).",
	"unnatural/camera_settle_rate": "Settle: how quickly it swings round behind the fish swimming straight, and while it\'s turning (1/s; 0: holds still while turning).",
	"unnatural/camera_settle_smoothing": "Settle: how long the fish\'s turning is averaged over (s), so a stride\'s sweep one way and back cancels out; longer is calmer but slower to notice a turn.",
	"unnatural/camera_settle_turn": "Settle: the fish\'s turn rate that counts as fully turning (degrees/s; lower and gentle curves count as turns too).",
	"unnatural/camera_settle_turning_rate": "Settle: how quickly it swings round behind the fish swimming straight, and while it\'s turning (1/s; 0: holds still while turning).",
	"unnatural/camera_size_pull": "The survivor cam pulls back as the horde thickens round you: up to camera_crowd_pull m further once camera_crowd_full zombies are within camera_crowd_range m; and camera_size_pull m per +100% of the Size stat, so big builds still fit. It eases there at camera_pull_rate (1/s).",
	"unnatural/camera_swing_rate": "Hold: how quickly it swings round behind the fish once accelerate, reverse and boost are let go (1/s).",
	"unnatural/camera_tilt": "Further back, higher and tilted further down than the tuned chase view (m, m, degrees), to see the horde around you.",
	"unnatural/camera_turn_rate": "How quickly it turns to the way the fish swims (1/s; lower is calmer).",
	"unnatural/carcass_armour": "The Whale Fall: a dead whale hagfish_count giant hagfish (hagfish_length m) have eaten hollow. Each lunges at a player within hagfish_reach m of where it comes out every hagfish_lunge_every s, and spits slime (slime_damage a touch, slowing you, for slime_time s). They hold hagfish_share of its hp between them; the carcass takes carcass_armour of the damage until they\'re all dead. In fury they tear free and hunt.",
	"unnatural/card_choices": "Each level-up offers this many cards, each a different weapon or tome (0: no cards, just the hp and signature stat). Every other fish\'s weapon is equally likely as a new one, and a card\'s rarity is rolled for it, not fixed by the weapon.",
	"unnatural/card_weight_new_tome": "Each level-up card is one of these, by weight: upgrade a weapon you hold, upgrade a tome you hold, a new weapon (only with a weapon slot free), a new tome (only with a tome slot free).",
	"unnatural/card_weight_new_weapon": "Each level-up card is one of these, by weight: upgrade a weapon you hold, upgrade a tome you hold, a new weapon (only with a weapon slot free), a new tome (only with a tome slot free).",
	"unnatural/card_weight_tome": "Each level-up card is one of these, by weight: upgrade a weapon you hold, upgrade a tome you hold, a new weapon (only with a weapon slot free), a new tome (only with a tome slot free).",
	"unnatural/card_weight_weapon": "Each level-up card is one of these, by weight: upgrade a weapon you hold, upgrade a tome you hold, a new weapon (only with a weapon slot free), a new tome (only with a tome slot free).",
	"unnatural/cards_pause": "Solo, the game pauses while the cards are up (co-op: the picker can\'t be hurt or seen by zombies instead).",
	"unnatural/chance_softness": "Chances (Crit Chance, every item\'s proc chance) bend so they never reach 100%: raw / (1 + raw ^ p) ^ (1 / p), p chance_softness. 2: 5% stays 5%, 50% is 45%, 100% is 71%. Higher stays straight longer; 0: a plain sum capped at 100%.",
	"unnatural/chest_bury_fade": "Chests get rarer as the stage goes on (P4): the drop chance is divided by 1 + chest_drop_fade x minutes into the stage (0.06: 63% at 10 min), and a new chest is uncovered every chest_interval x (1 + chest_bury_fade x minutes).",
	"unnatural/chest_chain_open": "Every chest in reach counts down together. Once you take a chest\'s pick, the next one unlocked and still in reach opens straight away (off: press Jump again).",
	"unnatural/chest_choices": "A chest offers this many powerups (different ones) to pick from.",
	"unnatural/chest_cost": "Chests cost pearls (D23; off: free). The price is chest_price_base x (1 + chest_price_growth x minutes into the run; 0: no growth over time); a cursed chest\'s is chest_cursed_price times that, a boss\'s free. Each player pays from their own purse for the chests they open.",
	"unnatural/chest_count": "Chests buried round the arena at the start, one more uncovered every chest_interval seconds, up to chest_max out (unopened) at once.",
	"unnatural/chest_cursed_price": "Each chest a player has paid for on this map raises their next one\'s price by this share of the base (0.25: the 10th costs 3.25x the first).",
	"unnatural/chest_drop_chance": "Each kill has this chance of dropping a chest (an elite\'s: elite_chest_scale times it), times 1 + the killer\'s luck x chest_drop_luck (which lifts the drops\' chances too). Every chest is every player\'s: each opens it for themselves.",
	"unnatural/chest_drop_fade": "Chests get rarer as the stage goes on (P4): the drop chance is divided by 1 + chest_drop_fade x minutes into the stage (0.06: 63% at 10 min), and a new chest is uncovered every chest_interval x (1 + chest_bury_fade x minutes).",
	"unnatural/chest_drop_luck": "Each kill has this chance of dropping a chest (an elite\'s: elite_chest_scale times it), times 1 + the killer\'s luck x chest_drop_luck (which lifts the drops\' chances too). Every chest is every player\'s: each opens it for themselves.",
	"unnatural/chest_interval": "Chests buried round the arena at the start, one more uncovered every chest_interval seconds, up to chest_max out (unopened) at once.",
	"unnatural/chest_max": "Chests buried round the arena at the start, one more uncovered every chest_interval seconds, up to chest_max out (unopened) at once.",
	"unnatural/chest_open_time": "Open one by battering it (at the battering speed, within chest_reach m of your front), or by holding still (under chest_still_speed m/s) within chest_reach for chest_open_time s. Opening and picking its powerup, you can\'t be hurt or seen (D3).",
	"unnatural/chest_price_base": "Chests cost pearls (D23; off: free). The price is chest_price_base x (1 + chest_price_growth x minutes into the run; 0: no growth over time); a cursed chest\'s is chest_cursed_price times that, a boss\'s free. Each player pays from their own purse for the chests they open.",
	"unnatural/chest_price_growth": "Chests cost pearls (D23; off: free). The price is chest_price_base x (1 + chest_price_growth x minutes into the run; 0: no growth over time); a cursed chest\'s is chest_cursed_price times that, a boss\'s free. Each player pays from their own purse for the chests they open.",
	"unnatural/chest_price_step": "Each chest a player has paid for on this map raises their next one\'s price by this share of the base (0.25: the 10th costs 3.25x the first).",
	"unnatural/chest_reach": "Open one by battering it (at the battering speed, within chest_reach m of your front), or by holding still (under chest_still_speed m/s) within chest_reach for chest_open_time s. Opening and picking its powerup, you can\'t be hurt or seen (D3).",
	"unnatural/chest_sense_range": "Within this (m) the HUD pings a chest.",
	"unnatural/chest_still_speed": "Open one by battering it (at the battering speed, within chest_reach m of your front), or by holding still (under chest_still_speed m/s) within chest_reach for chest_open_time s. Opening and picking its powerup, you can\'t be hurt or seen (D3).",
	"unnatural/chomp_anticipate": "Every jawed boss\'s chomp (ChompKit) as a real bite\'s beats: the head pulls back (chomp_pull times its bite\'s reach) and the snout lifts (chomp_lift rad) over chomp_anticipate s, the jaw drops open (fast, then slowing) over chomp_gape s and holds wide for chomp_hold s; these three are scaled together to fit each boss\'s own chomp wind (shark_chomp_wind, king_chomp_wind). Then the strike: the head lunges chomp_lunge times the reach as the jaws slam shut over chomp_strike s; it saws side to side (chomp_saw rad) for chomp_shake s, and settles over chomp_recover s.",
	"unnatural/chomp_cam_kick": "A chomp that lands, on the victim: their camera shakes chomp_cam_shake m (at chomp_damage_ref damage; more for more, up to twice) and kicks chomp_cam_kick m toward the boss; the boss and the victim freeze for chomp_hit_stop s (no global slow-down) as their fish squashes by chomp_squash; they\'re knocked chomp_knockback m/s from the mouth; the red vignette flushes chomp_vignette strong; their pad rumbles chomp_rumble (0 to 1) for chomp_rumble_time s; its damage number is chomp_number_scale times bigger, in red.",
	"unnatural/chomp_cam_shake": "A chomp that lands, on the victim: their camera shakes chomp_cam_shake m (at chomp_damage_ref damage; more for more, up to twice) and kicks chomp_cam_kick m toward the boss; the boss and the victim freeze for chomp_hit_stop s (no global slow-down) as their fish squashes by chomp_squash; they\'re knocked chomp_knockback m/s from the mouth; the red vignette flushes chomp_vignette strong; their pad rumbles chomp_rumble (0 to 1) for chomp_rumble_time s; its damage number is chomp_number_scale times bigger, in red.",
	"unnatural/chomp_contact": "The bite lands on the tick the jaws are this shut (0.9: 90%), from where the mouth is then: the lunge counts, and a side-step during the hold dodges it.",
	"unnatural/chomp_cue_rumble": "The pad\'s rumble on the chomp\'s beats (times chomp_rumble): a growl building through the wind-up and hold, a thump as the jaws drop and a rolling shudder as it saws. The landing\'s own impact is chomp_rumble. 0: only the landing.",
	"unnatural/chomp_damage_ref": "A chomp that lands, on the victim: their camera shakes chomp_cam_shake m (at chomp_damage_ref damage; more for more, up to twice) and kicks chomp_cam_kick m toward the boss; the boss and the victim freeze for chomp_hit_stop s (no global slow-down) as their fish squashes by chomp_squash; they\'re knocked chomp_knockback m/s from the mouth; the red vignette flushes chomp_vignette strong; their pad rumbles chomp_rumble (0 to 1) for chomp_rumble_time s; its damage number is chomp_number_scale times bigger, in red.",
	"unnatural/chomp_gape": "Every jawed boss\'s chomp (ChompKit) as a real bite\'s beats: the head pulls back (chomp_pull times its bite\'s reach) and the snout lifts (chomp_lift rad) over chomp_anticipate s, the jaw drops open (fast, then slowing) over chomp_gape s and holds wide for chomp_hold s; these three are scaled together to fit each boss\'s own chomp wind (shark_chomp_wind, king_chomp_wind). Then the strike: the head lunges chomp_lunge times the reach as the jaws slam shut over chomp_strike s; it saws side to side (chomp_saw rad) for chomp_shake s, and settles over chomp_recover s.",
	"unnatural/chomp_hit_stop": "A chomp that lands, on the victim: their camera shakes chomp_cam_shake m (at chomp_damage_ref damage; more for more, up to twice) and kicks chomp_cam_kick m toward the boss; the boss and the victim freeze for chomp_hit_stop s (no global slow-down) as their fish squashes by chomp_squash; they\'re knocked chomp_knockback m/s from the mouth; the red vignette flushes chomp_vignette strong; their pad rumbles chomp_rumble (0 to 1) for chomp_rumble_time s; its damage number is chomp_number_scale times bigger, in red.",
	"unnatural/chomp_hold": "Every jawed boss\'s chomp (ChompKit) as a real bite\'s beats: the head pulls back (chomp_pull times its bite\'s reach) and the snout lifts (chomp_lift rad) over chomp_anticipate s, the jaw drops open (fast, then slowing) over chomp_gape s and holds wide for chomp_hold s; these three are scaled together to fit each boss\'s own chomp wind (shark_chomp_wind, king_chomp_wind). Then the strike: the head lunges chomp_lunge times the reach as the jaws slam shut over chomp_strike s; it saws side to side (chomp_saw rad) for chomp_shake s, and settles over chomp_recover s.",
	"unnatural/chomp_knockback": "A chomp that lands, on the victim: their camera shakes chomp_cam_shake m (at chomp_damage_ref damage; more for more, up to twice) and kicks chomp_cam_kick m toward the boss; the boss and the victim freeze for chomp_hit_stop s (no global slow-down) as their fish squashes by chomp_squash; they\'re knocked chomp_knockback m/s from the mouth; the red vignette flushes chomp_vignette strong; their pad rumbles chomp_rumble (0 to 1) for chomp_rumble_time s; its damage number is chomp_number_scale times bigger, in red.",
