	"unnatural/chomp_vignette": "A chomp that lands, on the victim: their camera shakes chomp_cam_shake m (at chomp_damage_ref damage; more for more, up to twice) and kicks chomp_cam_kick m toward the boss; the boss and the victim freeze for chomp_hit_stop s (no global slow-down) as their fish squashes by chomp_squash; they\'re knocked chomp_knockback m/s from the mouth; the red vignette flushes chomp_vignette strong; their pad rumbles chomp_rumble (0 to 1) for chomp_rumble_time s; its damage number is chomp_number_scale times bigger, in red.",
