	"unnatural/coil_from_phase": "Signature moves before fury (fury makes them faster, not possible): - the King coils round a player it reaches as it dives from coil_from_phase;",
	"unnatural/coil_loops": "In fury the King wraps a player it reaches in coil_loops loops of its body, from coil_radius m round them tightening to coil_tight m over the hold; its squeeze drains up to coil_squeeze times final_hold_damage as it tightens. Each stride loosens it by coil_loosen, and so does each 1% of its hp a friend knocks off it meanwhile.",
	"unnatural/coil_loosen": "In fury the King wraps a player it reaches in coil_loops loops of its body, from coil_radius m round them tightening to coil_tight m over the hold; its squeeze drains up to coil_squeeze times final_hold_damage as it tightens. Each stride loosens it by coil_loosen, and so does each 1% of its hp a friend knocks off it meanwhile.",
