	"unnatural/compass_ring": "A compass ring round the minimap: ticks every 15 degrees and N, E, S, W (north is the arena\'s -Z), turning with the map.",
	"unnatural/compass_strip": "A heading strip across the top of the view, under the XP bar: the same ticks and letters, with markers for found shrines, bosses, the whirlpool, teammates and your chests within chest_sense_range, each with its distance.",
