	"unnatural/coop_scale": "Zombies alive the director aims for: base_alive + alive_per_minute * minutes ^ alive_curve, times 1 + coop_scale per extra player.",
	"unnatural/corals": "Corals (staghorn, brain, table and fan) and sponges (tube, barrel), in reef patches.",
