	"unnatural/cursed_chest_chance": "A buried chest\'s chance of being cursed (blood red): it offers cursed powerups, strong with a catch. Luck doesn\'t change it (D13).",
	"unnatural/damage_number_merge": "Their size (px at 720p, 14 m from the camera: smaller further off), how long each floats up (s), and the merge window (s).",
