	"unnatural/damage_numbers": "Damage numbers (the Playability pass, P3) over the zombies your hits land on. Hits on the same zombie within damage_number_merge s add up into one number (so a burning crowd stays readable); only numbers of damage_numbers_min or more show (0: all). At most damage_numbers_max at once (the oldest go first).",
	"unnatural/damage_numbers_max": "Damage numbers (the Playability pass, P3) over the zombies your hits land on. Hits on the same zombie within damage_number_merge s add up into one number (so a burning crowd stays readable); only numbers of damage_numbers_min or more show (0: all). At most damage_numbers_max at once (the oldest go first).",
	"unnatural/damage_numbers_min": "Damage numbers (the Playability pass, P3) over the zombies your hits land on. Hits on the same zombie within damage_number_merge s add up into one number (so a burning crowd stays readable); only numbers of damage_numbers_min or more show (0: all). At most damage_numbers_max at once (the oldest go first).",
	"unnatural/damage_numbers_team": "Teammates\' hits show too (fainter).",
	"unnatural/dash_cooldown": "Every fish\'s mobility skill is on the boost button (RB, Shift): it takes the place of boosting in Unnatural. Each has its own cooldown (s).",
	"unnatural/dash_iframes": "Swordfish, Dash (mobility): adds dash_speed (m/s) along its nose, untouchable for dash_iframes s.",
	"unnatural/dash_speed": "Swordfish, Dash (mobility): adds dash_speed (m/s) along its nose, untouchable for dash_iframes s.",
	"unnatural/depth_assist": "Depth assist (0: off, 1: strong, more: stronger still): the horde drifts toward the depth of the player it chases, and auto-aim favours zombies near your own depth, so the 40 m band plays more like a 2.5D arena without being locked to one.",
	"unnatural/difficulty_damage": "How hp grows with the difficulty level: 1 + difficulty_hp x level ^ this (1: in a line; more: faster and faster, to keep up with a build\'s power).",
	"unnatural/difficulty_hp": "Difficulty: a level that grows difficulty_per_minute a minute. Each zombie keeps the level it spawned at: per level, difficulty_hp more hp, difficulty_damage more contact damage, difficulty_speed more speed, and difficulty_size bigger, up to difficulty_size_max times its size.",
	"unnatural/difficulty_hp_curve": "How hp grows with the difficulty level: 1 + difficulty_hp x level ^ this (1: in a line; more: faster and faster, to keep up with a build\'s power).",
	"unnatural/difficulty_per_minute": "Difficulty: a level that grows difficulty_per_minute a minute. Each zombie keeps the level it spawned at: per level, difficulty_hp more hp, difficulty_damage more contact damage, difficulty_speed more speed, and difficulty_size bigger, up to difficulty_size_max times its size.",
	"unnatural/difficulty_size": "How hp grows with the difficulty level: 1 + difficulty_hp x level ^ this (1: in a line; more: faster and faster, to keep up with a build\'s power).",
	"unnatural/difficulty_size_max": "How hp grows with the difficulty level: 1 + difficulty_hp x level ^ this (1: in a line; more: faster and faster, to keep up with a build\'s power).",
	"unnatural/difficulty_speed": "How hp grows with the difficulty level: 1 + difficulty_hp x level ^ this (1: in a line; more: faster and faster, to keep up with a build\'s power).",
	"unnatural/drift_pulse": "Grave Jellies surge once every drift_pulse s, at up to drift_surge x their speed, and coast between; their sting slows (frozen_slow) for jelly_sting_time s.",
	"unnatural/drift_surge": "Grave Jellies surge once every drift_pulse s, at up to drift_surge x their speed, and coast between; their sting slows (frozen_slow) for jelly_sting_time s.",
	"unnatural/drop_gap": "Drops are timed, not only rolled: late in a run thousands of kills a minute would roll one every few seconds. After a drop of a kind, that kind can\'t drop again for its time below (s; 0: no wait), and after any drop nothing drops for drop_gap s. Once the wait\'s up, kills roll for it again as above.",
	"unnatural/easy_kill_rate": "Mowing through them too easily (each player killing easy_kill_rate a second or more, over the last 10 s, while intensity is under calm_intensity) raises the pressure, a multiplier on the target alive, by pressure_rate a second up to pressure_max; high intensity lowers it, down to pressure_min.",
	"unnatural/edge_kelp": "The arena\'s edge, so it reads from far off: tall rock outcrops and a thick band of tall kelp round it (and a faint red wall of light), from the seabed to the top of the depth band.",
	"unnatural/edge_push": "How hard the arena\'s edge pushes a fish back in (m/s² at 1 m past it, more further out).",
	"unnatural/edge_rocks": "The arena\'s edge, so it reads from far off: tall rock outcrops and a thick band of tall kelp round it (and a faint red wall of light), from the seabed to the top of the depth band.",
	"unnatural/electric": "Electric: dying, it crackles for electric_delay s (a ring shows where), then shocks everything within electric_radius m for electric_damage.",
	"unnatural/electric_damage": "Electric: dying, it crackles for electric_delay s (a ring shows where), then shocks everything within electric_radius m for electric_damage.",
	"unnatural/electric_delay": "Electric: dying, it crackles for electric_delay s (a ring shows where), then shocks everything within electric_radius m for electric_damage.",
	"unnatural/electric_radius": "Electric: dying, it crackles for electric_delay s (a ring shows where), then shocks everything within electric_radius m for electric_damage.",
	"unnatural/elite_chance": "The chance a zombie spawns elite (bigger, 5x hp, glowing, a 5x XP pearl): elite_chance + elite_per_minute * minutes.",
	"unnatural/elite_chest_scale": "Each kill has this chance of dropping a chest (an elite\'s: elite_chest_scale times it), times 1 + the killer\'s luck x chest_drop_luck (which lifts the drops\' chances too). Every chest is every player\'s: each opens it for themselves.",
	"unnatural/elite_modifier_chance": "Elites (P5, RoR2 style): an elite has elite_modifier_chance of a modifier, each glowing its own colour, and drops chests modifier_chest_scale x as often as a plain elite.",
	"unnatural/elite_per_minute": "The chance a zombie spawns elite (bigger, 5x hp, glowing, a 5x XP pearl): elite_chance + elite_per_minute * minutes.",
	"unnatural/elite_size": "How much bigger an elite is than the rest of its kind (its body and its reach), so it stands out in the crowd.",
	"unnatural/enemy_damage_scale": "Every zombie\'s hp, speed and contact damage are multiplied by these.",
