	"unnatural/enrage_scale": "Not beaten leviathan_enrage s after it came, it enrages: faster and harder by enrage_scale, and the director keeps escalating (D5: no time limit).",
	"unnatural/escort_regen": "Breachers (baby whales), Escort: holding still (slower than chest_still_speed), it heals this many hp a second.",
