	"unnatural/eye_glow": "The rot on their skins (0: their own colours, 1: all rot) and their eyes\' glow.",
	"unnatural/eye_handoff": "Zombies close enough to see have a pair of red eyes on their heads (near_eye_strength, their glow; 0: none). For the last eye_handoff m before the glints start, the eyes cross over to the glints, so they never vanish as a zombie closes in. head_glow: the faint red rot glow over the front of the head (times eye_glow).",
