	"unnatural/fill_target_min": "The run simulator (tests/run_sim.tscn) flags the minutes when the horde\'s fill (zombies out over the number the director wants out) is under this: the build wipes each pack as it comes, too strong for the curve.",
	"unnatural/fin_cooldown": "Shark, Fin Dash: charges ahead at fin_dash_speed (m/s) for fin_dash_time s, untouchable, battering everything in the way; every zombie it passes within fin_radius m takes fin_damage once.",
	"unnatural/fin_damage": "Shark, Fin Dash: charges ahead at fin_dash_speed (m/s) for fin_dash_time s, untouchable, battering everything in the way; every zombie it passes within fin_radius m takes fin_damage once.",
	"unnatural/fin_dash_speed": "Shark, Fin Dash: charges ahead at fin_dash_speed (m/s) for fin_dash_time s, untouchable, battering everything in the way; every zombie it passes within fin_radius m takes fin_damage once.",
	"unnatural/fin_dash_time": "Shark, Fin Dash: charges ahead at fin_dash_speed (m/s) for fin_dash_time s, untouchable, battering everything in the way; every zombie it passes within fin_radius m takes fin_damage once.",
	"unnatural/fin_radius": "Shark, Fin Dash: charges ahead at fin_dash_speed (m/s) for fin_dash_time s, untouchable, battering everything in the way; every zombie it passes within fin_radius m takes fin_damage once.",
	"unnatural/final_boss": "Which final boss comes: the King of Herrings (a giant rotting oarfish), or one of its alternates, by alternate_boss_chance (each equally likely): the Gulper Mother, the Whale Fall, the Lamprey Queen, the Fallen Angel. Pick one to always get it (testing). They share the Blood Leviathan group\'s hp, speed and timings.",
	"unnatural/final_hold_damage": "The Gulper and the Lamprey grab a player whose fish touches their mouth as they charge: held there, drained final_hold_damage every 0.75 s, until they stride final_hold_strides times or final_hold_time s pass.",
	"unnatural/final_hold_strides": "The Gulper and the Lamprey grab a player whose fish touches their mouth as they charge: held there, drained final_hold_damage every 0.75 s, until they stride final_hold_strides times or final_hold_time s pass.",
