	"unnatural/gill_bonus": "The Lamprey Queen: every brood_every s one of her brood drops off as brood_count zombies; hits on her gill holes do gill_bonus times the damage; spitting, her gills pulse out blood clouds (blood_cloud_damage a touch).",
