	"unnatural/glint_distance": "Red eyes in the dark: zombies from where the fog is glint_from thick out to glint_distance (m; 0: none) show a pair of glowing eyes through the murk, fading with distance. A hint of the next wave, not a beacon.",
	"unnatural/glint_fade_far": "The share of the glint band (from where they start out to glint_distance) over which the eyes dim away at its far end, a smooth ramp (0: a hard edge; 1: they dim all the way out).",
	"unnatural/glint_from": "Red eyes in the dark: zombies from where the fog is glint_from thick out to glint_distance (m; 0: none) show a pair of glowing eyes through the murk, fading with distance. A hint of the next wave, not a beacon.",
