	"unnatural/gulper_aggression": "How hard the final bosses press (the Fallen Angel\'s pressure is the target): boss_aggression multiplies how often they attack (dives, chomps, bolts, gulps and sucks, lunges, hagfish strikes) and divides their rests; each boss\'s own value multiplies it again (1: as tuned, 2: twice as often).",
	"unnatural/gulper_every": "The Gulper Mother: every gulper_every s it opens wide and draws in the zombies within gulper_range m of its mouth (gulper_pull m/s), swallowing up to gulper_max, each healing it gulper_heal of its max hp. Spitting, it vomits gulper_vomit zombies at you as well as its bile.",
	"unnatural/gulper_heal": "The Gulper Mother: every gulper_every s it opens wide and draws in the zombies within gulper_range m of its mouth (gulper_pull m/s), swallowing up to gulper_max, each healing it gulper_heal of its max hp. Spitting, it vomits gulper_vomit zombies at you as well as its bile.",
	"unnatural/gulper_max": "The Gulper Mother: every gulper_every s it opens wide and draws in the zombies within gulper_range m of its mouth (gulper_pull m/s), swallowing up to gulper_max, each healing it gulper_heal of its max hp. Spitting, it vomits gulper_vomit zombies at you as well as its bile.",
	"unnatural/gulper_pull": "The Gulper Mother: every gulper_every s it opens wide and draws in the zombies within gulper_range m of its mouth (gulper_pull m/s), swallowing up to gulper_max, each healing it gulper_heal of its max hp. Spitting, it vomits gulper_vomit zombies at you as well as its bile.",
	"unnatural/gulper_range": "The Gulper Mother: every gulper_every s it opens wide and draws in the zombies within gulper_range m of its mouth (gulper_pull m/s), swallowing up to gulper_max, each healing it gulper_heal of its max hp. Spitting, it vomits gulper_vomit zombies at you as well as its bile.",
	"unnatural/gulper_suck": "In fury the Gulper sucks: a player within gulper_suck_range m in front of its mouth is drawn in at up to gulper_suck m/s; reached, its jaws snap shut and they\'re swallowed, a lump in its belly, until they stride their way back out.",
	"unnatural/gulper_suck_circle": "- the Gulper sucks: every gulper_suck_every s it turns on its target, mouth wide (its suction stream and lane showing), and sucks for gulper_suck_time s, at gulper_suck times gulper_suck_circle (first phase) or gulper_suck_spit (from two thirds); in fury, whenever a player\'s ahead;",
	"unnatural/gulper_suck_every": "- the Gulper sucks: every gulper_suck_every s it turns on its target, mouth wide (its suction stream and lane showing), and sucks for gulper_suck_time s, at gulper_suck times gulper_suck_circle (first phase) or gulper_suck_spit (from two thirds); in fury, whenever a player\'s ahead;",
	"unnatural/gulper_suck_range": "In fury the Gulper sucks: a player within gulper_suck_range m in front of its mouth is drawn in at up to gulper_suck m/s; reached, its jaws snap shut and they\'re swallowed, a lump in its belly, until they stride their way back out.",
