	"unnatural/gulper_suck_time": "- the Gulper sucks: every gulper_suck_every s it turns on its target, mouth wide (its suction stream and lane showing), and sucks for gulper_suck_time s, at gulper_suck times gulper_suck_circle (first phase) or gulper_suck_spit (from two thirds); in fury, whenever a player\'s ahead;",
	"unnatural/gulper_vomit": "The Gulper Mother: every gulper_every s it opens wide and draws in the zombies within gulper_range m of its mouth (gulper_pull m/s), swallowing up to gulper_max, each healing it gulper_heal of its max hp. Spitting, it vomits gulper_vomit zombies at you as well as its bile.",
	"unnatural/hagfish_count": "The Whale Fall: a dead whale hagfish_count giant hagfish (hagfish_length m) have eaten hollow. Each lunges at a player within hagfish_reach m of where it comes out every hagfish_lunge_every s, and spits slime (slime_damage a touch, slowing you, for slime_time s). They hold hagfish_share of its hp between them; the carcass takes carcass_armour of the damage until they\'re all dead. In fury they tear free and hunt.",
	"unnatural/hagfish_free_spit": "- at two thirds hagfish_free_spit of the Whale Fall\'s hagfish tear free and hunt (all of them in fury), and the rest reach hagfish_reach_growth more per phase; a loose one strikes from hagfish_hunt_strike m.",
	"unnatural/hagfish_fury_catchup": "A loose hagfish hunts at hagfish_hunt_speed m/s (times its rate), and up to hagfish_fury_hunt times that in fury, so a player who kites can\'t simply out-swim them all. The fury speed-up is catch-up only: none within hagfish_hunt_strike m of the goal, all of it from hagfish_fury_catchup m out, so a player fighting up close isn\'t hounded any harder.",
	"unnatural/hagfish_fury_hunt": "A loose hagfish hunts at hagfish_hunt_speed m/s (times its rate), and up to hagfish_fury_hunt times that in fury, so a player who kites can\'t simply out-swim them all. The fury speed-up is catch-up only: none within hagfish_hunt_strike m of the goal, all of it from hagfish_fury_catchup m out, so a player fighting up close isn\'t hounded any harder.",
	"unnatural/hagfish_grabs": "A striking hagfish that reaches a player bites and holds on, reeling them in toward the carcass as it ties itself in a knot (over hagfish_knot_time s) that slides down its body to its head. When it lets go it slimes them.",
	"unnatural/hagfish_hunt_speed": "A loose hagfish hunts at hagfish_hunt_speed m/s (times its rate), and up to hagfish_fury_hunt times that in fury, so a player who kites can\'t simply out-swim them all. The fury speed-up is catch-up only: none within hagfish_hunt_strike m of the goal, all of it from hagfish_fury_catchup m out, so a player fighting up close isn\'t hounded any harder.",
	"unnatural/hagfish_hunt_strike": "- at two thirds hagfish_free_spit of the Whale Fall\'s hagfish tear free and hunt (all of them in fury), and the rest reach hagfish_reach_growth more per phase; a loose one strikes from hagfish_hunt_strike m.",
	"unnatural/hagfish_knot_time": "A striking hagfish that reaches a player bites and holds on, reeling them in toward the carcass as it ties itself in a knot (over hagfish_knot_time s) that slides down its body to its head. When it lets go it slimes them.",
	"unnatural/hagfish_length": "The Whale Fall: a dead whale hagfish_count giant hagfish (hagfish_length m) have eaten hollow. Each lunges at a player within hagfish_reach m of where it comes out every hagfish_lunge_every s, and spits slime (slime_damage a touch, slowing you, for slime_time s). They hold hagfish_share of its hp between them; the carcass takes carcass_armour of the damage until they\'re all dead. In fury they tear free and hunt.",
	"unnatural/hagfish_lunge_every": "The Whale Fall: a dead whale hagfish_count giant hagfish (hagfish_length m) have eaten hollow. Each lunges at a player within hagfish_reach m of where it comes out every hagfish_lunge_every s, and spits slime (slime_damage a touch, slowing you, for slime_time s). They hold hagfish_share of its hp between them; the carcass takes carcass_armour of the damage until they\'re all dead. In fury they tear free and hunt.",
	"unnatural/hagfish_reach": "The Whale Fall: a dead whale hagfish_count giant hagfish (hagfish_length m) have eaten hollow. Each lunges at a player within hagfish_reach m of where it comes out every hagfish_lunge_every s, and spits slime (slime_damage a touch, slowing you, for slime_time s). They hold hagfish_share of its hp between them; the carcass takes carcass_armour of the damage until they\'re all dead. In fury they tear free and hunt.",
	"unnatural/hagfish_reach_growth": "- at two thirds hagfish_free_spit of the Whale Fall\'s hagfish tear free and hunt (all of them in fury), and the rest reach hagfish_reach_growth more per phase; a loose one strikes from hagfish_hunt_strike m.",
	"unnatural/hagfish_share": "The Whale Fall: a dead whale hagfish_count giant hagfish (hagfish_length m) have eaten hollow. Each lunges at a player within hagfish_reach m of where it comes out every hagfish_lunge_every s, and spits slime (slime_damage a touch, slowing you, for slime_time s). They hold hagfish_share of its hp between them; the carcass takes carcass_armour of the damage until they\'re all dead. In fury they tear free and hunt.",
	"unnatural/head_glow": "Zombies close enough to see have a pair of red eyes on their heads (near_eye_strength, their glow; 0: none). For the last eye_handoff m before the glints start, the eyes cross over to the glints, so they never vanish as a zombie closes in. head_glow: the faint red rot glow over the front of the head (times eye_glow).",
	"unnatural/heart_chance": "A kill\'s chance of dropping a heart (heals the whole team heart_heal of max hp), a magnet (every XP pearl out flies to the taker), an hourglass (every zombie stops dead for hourglass_time s; bosses don\'t) or a lightning bolt (a shock across the whole arena kills every zombie; bosses are spared). An elite\'s: 5x. The first player to touch one takes it.",
	"unnatural/heart_every": "Drops are timed, not only rolled: late in a run thousands of kills a minute would roll one every few seconds. After a drop of a kind, that kind can\'t drop again for its time below (s; 0: no wait), and after any drop nothing drops for drop_gap s. Once the wait\'s up, kills roll for it again as above.",
	"unnatural/heart_heal": "A kill\'s chance of dropping a heart (heals the whole team heart_heal of max hp), a magnet (every XP pearl out flies to the taker), an hourglass (every zombie stops dead for hourglass_time s; bosses don\'t) or a lightning bolt (a shock across the whole arena kills every zombie; bosses are spared). An elite\'s: 5x. The first player to touch one takes it.",
	"unnatural/heartbeat_vignette": "The red pulse round the view\'s edge when you\'re hurt (0: none), and the heartbeat it beats while you\'re under low_hp_share of your hp (the heartbeat sound starts there too).",
	"unnatural/heavy_flings": "Mantis Shrimp, Heavy Hitter: a zombie its punches knock back flies as a missile for heavy_time s: each other zombie it hits (up to heavy_max) takes heavy_share of the punch\'s damage, knocked on the way it flew. At most heavy_flings missiles at once (the oldest goes), to keep big hordes cheap.",
	"unnatural/heavy_max": "Mantis Shrimp, Heavy Hitter: a zombie its punches knock back flies as a missile for heavy_time s: each other zombie it hits (up to heavy_max) takes heavy_share of the punch\'s damage, knocked on the way it flew. At most heavy_flings missiles at once (the oldest goes), to keep big hordes cheap.",
	"unnatural/heavy_share": "Mantis Shrimp, Heavy Hitter: a zombie its punches knock back flies as a missile for heavy_time s: each other zombie it hits (up to heavy_max) takes heavy_share of the punch\'s damage, knocked on the way it flew. At most heavy_flings missiles at once (the oldest goes), to keep big hordes cheap.",
	"unnatural/heavy_time": "Mantis Shrimp, Heavy Hitter: a zombie its punches knock back flies as a missile for heavy_time s: each other zombie it hits (up to heavy_max) takes heavy_share of the punch\'s damage, knocked on the way it flew. At most heavy_flings missiles at once (the oldest goes), to keep big hordes cheap.",
	"unnatural/hit_flash": "How white a hit zombie flashes (0: no flash).",
	"unnatural/hourglass_chance": "A kill\'s chance of dropping a heart (heals the whole team heart_heal of max hp), a magnet (every XP pearl out flies to the taker), an hourglass (every zombie stops dead for hourglass_time s; bosses don\'t) or a lightning bolt (a shock across the whole arena kills every zombie; bosses are spared). An elite\'s: 5x. The first player to touch one takes it.",
	"unnatural/hourglass_every": "Drops are timed, not only rolled: late in a run thousands of kills a minute would roll one every few seconds. After a drop of a kind, that kind can\'t drop again for its time below (s; 0: no wait), and after any drop nothing drops for drop_gap s. Once the wait\'s up, kills roll for it again as above.",
	"unnatural/hourglass_time": "A kill\'s chance of dropping a heart (heals the whole team heart_heal of max hp), a magnet (every XP pearl out flies to the taker), an hourglass (every zombie stops dead for hourglass_time s; bosses don\'t) or a lightning bolt (a shock across the whole arena kills every zombie; bosses are spared). An elite\'s: 5x. The first player to touch one takes it.",
	"unnatural/hp_per_level": "Max hp: base_hp + hp_per_level * (level - 1).",
	"unnatural/hurt_vignette": "The red pulse round the view\'s edge when you\'re hurt (0: none), and the heartbeat it beats while you\'re under low_hp_share of your hp (the heartbeat sound starts there too).",
	"unnatural/iframes": "Seconds a fish can\'t be hurt again after a hit (it flickers).",
	"unnatural/intensity_fade": "Intensity: the share of their max hp the players lost recently, fading by intensity_fade a second. At relief_intensity or more the director holds off new packs for relief_time seconds: a breather, then it comes again.",
	"unnatural/jelly_sting_time": "Grave Jellies surge once every drift_pulse s, at up to drift_surge x their speed, and coast between; their sting slows (frozen_slow) for jelly_sting_time s.",
	"unnatural/kill_pop_max": "A burst where a zombie dies: a ring and sparks, kill_pop_size times the zombie\'s size (0: none), at most kill_pop_max at once (a big wipe shows the newest). The dying zombie swells by kill_swell before it shrinks away.",
	"unnatural/kill_pop_size": "A burst where a zombie dies: a ring and sparks, kill_pop_size times the zombie\'s size (0: none), at most kill_pop_max at once (a big wipe shows the newest). The dying zombie swells by kill_swell before it shrinks away.",
	"unnatural/kill_swell": "A burst where a zombie dies: a ring and sparks, kill_pop_size times the zombie\'s size (0: none), at most kill_pop_max at once (a big wipe shows the newest). The dying zombie swells by kill_swell before it shrinks away.",
	"unnatural/king_aggression": "How hard the final bosses press (the Fallen Angel\'s pressure is the target): boss_aggression multiplies how often they attack (dives, chomps, bolts, gulps and sucks, lunges, hagfish strikes) and divides their rests; each boss\'s own value multiplies it again (1: as tuned, 2: twice as often).",
	"unnatural/king_chomp_damage": "The King of Herrings\' chomp, in any phase: a player within king_chomp_range m ahead of its mouth makes it wind up over king_chomp_wind s (the Chomps group\'s beats: pulling back, its jaw gaping, held wide) and snap shut, biting everyone within king_chomp_reach m of its mouth for king_chomp_damage; king_chomp_every s between chomps.",
	"unnatural/king_chomp_every": "The King of Herrings\' chomp, in any phase: a player within king_chomp_range m ahead of its mouth makes it wind up over king_chomp_wind s (the Chomps group\'s beats: pulling back, its jaw gaping, held wide) and snap shut, biting everyone within king_chomp_reach m of its mouth for king_chomp_damage; king_chomp_every s between chomps.",
	"unnatural/king_chomp_range": "The King of Herrings\' chomp, in any phase: a player within king_chomp_range m ahead of its mouth makes it wind up over king_chomp_wind s (the Chomps group\'s beats: pulling back, its jaw gaping, held wide) and snap shut, biting everyone within king_chomp_reach m of its mouth for king_chomp_damage; king_chomp_every s between chomps.",
	"unnatural/king_chomp_reach": "The King of Herrings\' chomp, in any phase: a player within king_chomp_range m ahead of its mouth makes it wind up over king_chomp_wind s (the Chomps group\'s beats: pulling back, its jaw gaping, held wide) and snap shut, biting everyone within king_chomp_reach m of its mouth for king_chomp_damage; king_chomp_every s between chomps.",
