	"unnatural/lamprey_lunge_range": "In fury she lunges: a player within lamprey_lunge_range m ahead makes her flare her disc for lamprey_lunge_wind s, then strike at lamprey_lunge_speed times her speed; one her disc reaches is latched onto, and she corkscrews round her length at lamprey_spin rad/s while she drains them.",
