	"unnatural/lamprey_spin": "In fury she lunges: a player within lamprey_lunge_range m ahead makes her flare her disc for lamprey_lunge_wind s, then strike at lamprey_lunge_speed times her speed; one her disc reaches is latched onto, and she corkscrews round her length at lamprey_spin rad/s while she drains them.",
	"unnatural/lash_arc_range": "The String Ray\'s: its tail whips the nearest zombie within lash_range (m), and the shock arcs on to lash_arcs more (one more per Quantity), each within lash_arc_range (m) of the last, for lash_arc_share of the damage.",
