	"unnatural/leviathan_dive_telegraph": "Its warnings (the Playability pass, P3): before each dive through its target it slows and glows for leviathan_dive_telegraph s, a red lane showing the way it\'ll come (0: no warning); its head glows for leviathan_spit_telegraph s before it spits.",
