	"unnatural/leviathan_spit_telegraph": "Its warnings (the Playability pass, P3): before each dive through its target it slows and glows for leviathan_dive_telegraph s, a red lane showing the way it\'ll come (0: no warning); its head glows for leviathan_spit_telegraph s before it spits.",
	"unnatural/lightning_chance": "A kill\'s chance of dropping a heart (heals the whole team heart_heal of max hp), a magnet (every XP pearl out flies to the taker), an hourglass (every zombie stops dead for hourglass_time s; bosses don\'t) or a lightning bolt (a shock across the whole arena kills every zombie; bosses are spared). An elite\'s: 5x. The first player to touch one takes it.",
	"unnatural/lightning_every": "Drops are timed, not only rolled: late in a run thousands of kills a minute would roll one every few seconds. After a drop of a kind, that kind can\'t drop again for its time below (s; 0: no wait), and after any drop nothing drops for drop_gap s. Once the wait\'s up, kills roll for it again as above.",
	"unnatural/limits": "The Playability pass\'s limiters (P4). Off: every stack and stat adds up in a line, as before (for comparing).",
	"unnatural/lod_far_distance": "Zombie detail by distance from the camera (scaled by their size): each part of a fish at its coarsest LOD within the error (a share of the part\'s size; 0: full detail). lod_near_error out to lod_mid_distance m, lod_mid_error out to lod_far_distance m, lod_far_error beyond.",
