	"unnatural/lunge_impact": "A zombie\'s lunge (or punch) landing gives a light impact: a camera tick of lunge_impact_shake times a chomp\'s, a rim flash of lunge_impact_flash, a knock of lunge_impact_knock m/s, a rumble of lunge_impact_rumble and a bubble puff; at most one per player every lunge_impact_every s (a swarm reads as a steady rattle, not a constant shake, and costs the same as one lunge).",
