	"unnatural/lunge_lanes": "How hard lunges and bosses\' attacks glow while they wind up (0: no glow), and a red lane on the water showing where a boss\'s charge or dive will go; with lunge_lanes, every swordfish\'s lunge gets one too (off: there are a lot of them, and their glow is warning enough).",
