	"unnatural/murk_cull": "Zombies are drawn only while the fog over them is under this (1: always drawn): -ln(1 - murk_cull) / density metres from the camera, plus murk_cull_margin. 0.98 at 0.035 is about 112 m.",
	"unnatural/murk_cull_margin": "Zombies are drawn only while the fog over them is under this (1: always drawn): -ln(1 - murk_cull) / density metres from the camera, plus murk_cull_margin. 0.98 at 0.035 is about 112 m.",
	"unnatural/murk_density": "Murky water (planning_murk.md): the fog\'s density in the arena (0: the ocean\'s own, with the blood moon\'s). The edge\'s thickening goes on top. At 0.035 the fog is 50% at 20 m, 85% at 55 m and 95% at 86 m.",
	"unnatural/murk_far": "Zombies where the fog over them is this thick or more (from every player) steer only every far_update_divisor-th step, instead of past far_distance (0: far_distance). 0.85 at 0.035 is about 54 m.",
	"unnatural/murk_frustum": "Zombies behind every camera aren\'t drawn either.",
	"unnatural/murk_sky": "How much of the sky the fog covers while it\'s murky (1: all of it, so nothing fogged out stands against the sky).",
	"unnatural/murk_spawn_anywhere": "With murk, packs may turn up in view too (in the murk, all round you), not only out of every player\'s view.",
	"unnatural/near_eye_strength": "Zombies close enough to see have a pair of red eyes on their heads (near_eye_strength, their glow; 0: none). For the last eye_handoff m before the glints start, the eyes cross over to the glints, so they never vanish as a zombie closes in. head_glow: the faint red rot glow over the front of the head (times eye_glow).",
	"unnatural/nimble_turn": "Clownfish, Nimble: turns this many times as sharply.",
	"unnatural/pearl_drop_chance": "Pearls are the currency (D23): chests cost them. A kill drops one by chance, pearl_drop_chance x (1 + the killer\'s Pearl Chance); an elite\'s by pearl_elite_chance (likewise), worth pearl_elite_value; a beaten mini-boss drops boss_pearls.",
	"unnatural/pearl_elite_chance": "Pearls are the currency (D23): chests cost them. A kill drops one by chance, pearl_drop_chance x (1 + the killer\'s Pearl Chance); an elite\'s by pearl_elite_chance (likewise), worth pearl_elite_value; a beaten mini-boss drops boss_pearls.",
	"unnatural/pearl_elite_value": "Pearls are the currency (D23): chests cost them. A kill drops one by chance, pearl_drop_chance x (1 + the killer\'s Pearl Chance); an elite\'s by pearl_elite_chance (likewise), worth pearl_elite_value; a beaten mini-boss drops boss_pearls.",
	"unnatural/pearl_lights": "Each pearl\'s own light (pretty, but costly with hundreds out).",
	"unnatural/pearl_size": "Pearls never fade: they wait until someone takes them.",
	"unnatural/per_view_horde": "Split-screen: each view draws only the zombies its own camera sees (on its player\'s render layer), rather than every view drawing what any of them sees.",
	"unnatural/pickup_beam": "Drops (hearts, magnets, hourglasses, bolts) send up a beam of their colour this tall (m; 0: none) that shows through the murk, and ping at the view\'s edge within pickup_sense_range m (0: no pings).",
	"unnatural/pickup_pull": "Pearls this near a fish (m) are drawn in: the pickup range.",
