	"unnatural/pickup_sense_range": "Drops (hearts, magnets, hourglasses, bolts) send up a beam of their colour this tall (m; 0: none) that shows through the murk, and ping at the view\'s edge within pickup_sense_range m (0: no pings).",
	"unnatural/pressure_max": "Mowing through them too easily (each player killing easy_kill_rate a second or more, over the last 10 s, while intensity is under calm_intensity) raises the pressure, a multiplier on the target alive, by pressure_rate a second up to pressure_max; high intensity lowers it, down to pressure_min.",
	"unnatural/pressure_min": "Mowing through them too easily (each player killing easy_kill_rate a second or more, over the last 10 s, while intensity is under calm_intensity) raises the pressure, a multiplier on the target alive, by pressure_rate a second up to pressure_max; high intensity lowers it, down to pressure_min.",
